+## Replay the last clear group call
+
+Where DMR replay is available, turn on **Settings > Talk & listen > Record clear DMR** for this session. In
+**Settings > Keys**, assign **Replay DMR** to a programmable key. Press it while on an idle DMR channel to listen
+through the speaker. Press it again to stop. A live signal or transmission takes priority over replay.
+
+The recorder keeps up to the first 30 seconds of the latest clear DMR group call whose opening header was heard.
+Private and encrypted calls are excluded. The recording is held in RAM and erased when recording is turned off or
+the radio powers down. Recording starts off at every power-up. A working DMR voice codec is required.
+
